1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:06,330
A robot turns a page, squeezes toothpaste, or transfers an egg between its hands.
机器人翻页、挤牙膏，或双手传递鸡蛋。

2
00:00:07,010 --> 00:00:14,110
The task plan may stay unchanged while contact forces change quickly; T-Rex gives those processes different update rates.
任务计划没变，接触已变；两者需要不同更新速度。

3
00:00:14,738 --> 00:00:20,338
The architecture contains a latent expert, an action expert, and a tactile expert.
架构包含潜变量、动作和触觉三个专家。

4
00:00:20,838 --> 00:00:28,818
Visual-language context supports a coarse action plan, while a smaller tactile pathway handles more frequent corrections within that plan.
视觉语言支撑粗动作，轻量触觉支路频繁修正。

5
00:00:29,303 --> 00:00:34,923
The slow expert performs the first part of flow-based action denoising and caches its context.
慢专家完成前半段动作去噪，并缓存上下文。

6
00:00:35,483 --> 00:00:41,143
The tactile expert reuses that context and completes the remaining steps with newer contact observations.
触觉专家复用缓存，用更新的接触观测完成后续。

7
00:00:41,880 --> 00:00:49,140
A temporal encoder compresses recent force history, alongside current force and fingertip deformation features.
时序编码器压缩力历史，并结合当前力和形变。

8
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:56,740
This preserves how contact changes over time, instead of treating each tactile measurement as an isolated static snapshot.
因此能利用接触如何变化，而不只看静态瞬间。

9
00:00:57,550 --> 00:01:04,550
Training proceeds from human-video pretraining to tactile-rich robot data, then task-specific demonstrations.
训练依次使用人类视频、触觉机器人数据和任务示教。

10
00:01:05,110 --> 00:01:13,290
The physical platform has two twenty-two-degree-of-freedom hands, so this paper directly studies multi-finger, bimanual contact behaviors.
双手各二十二自由度，直接研究双手多指接触。

11
00:01:14,044 --> 00:01:19,644
The main comparison covers twelve tasks with sixteen randomized trials per task.
主比较有十二项任务，每项随机测试十六次。

12
00:01:20,024 --> 00:01:26,964
Several tasks award credit for intermediate stages, so the reported average combines more than a strict pass-or-fail outcome.
若干任务给中间阶段分，汇总并非纯通过率。

13
00:01:27,474 --> 00:01:33,954
T-Rex reaches a sixty-five-percent average protocol score, compared with thirty-five for EgoScale.
协议平均得分六十五，EgoScale 为三十五。

14
00:01:34,614 --> 00:01:42,034
The thirty-point gap supports this matched comparison; it does not mean sixty-five percent of all trials fully completed every stage.
相差三十个百分点，不能解释为完整通过率六十五。

15
00:01:42,612 --> 00:01:49,192
Precise, extended tasks still fail through collisions, slipping, poor alignment, and imperfect coordination.
精密长任务仍会碰撞、滑移、对不齐或协调失败。

16
00:01:49,832 --> 00:01:57,312
Sensor drift and missing dense palm sensing further limit transfer, even when fingertip feedback reacts faster than visual planning.
传感漂移和掌部触觉不足，也会限制迁移。

17
00:01:57,856 --> 00:02:02,316
The lesson is not simply to concatenate touch with a large visual model.
重点不是把触觉直接拼到大视觉模型后面。

18
00:02:02,816 --> 00:02:12,456
T-Rex designs the data, representation, and execution schedule together so fast contact feedback can influence actions while broader task context remains available.
数据、表示与执行节奏要协同，让接触及时影响动作。
